			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750330101,
					"content": "Why must I persist? Why can't I just give up...? Forget it, I give up! Help me, Manyoya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330102,
					"content": "What an embarrassment! Stop acting like a child and giving up whenever things don't go smoothly. How can you even call yourself a warrior? I'm ashamed to call you my brother.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Matahga"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330103,
					"content": "And are you telling me you've never been stumped and needed help?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330104,
					"content": "I have, which is why I'm here to get Father and Manyoya's opinions on the fruits of my special training. I'm not a coward like you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Matahga"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330105,
					"content": "Acomitl, I believe the captain rejected your resignation so that you could give it more thought. Don't make important decisions in the heat of things.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manyoya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330106,
					"content": "Calm down and make your own choice. The most important thing is that you don't come to regret it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manyoya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330107,
					"content": "I'm retired, and even I don't know what the future holds for me, so I fear I haven't the right to give you any guidance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manyoya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330108,
					"content": "Whoa! So you three are siblings!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330109,
						750330110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330109,
					"content": "Didn't see that coming...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330111,
					"content": "It's you two!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330112,
					"content": "My apologies, dear benefactor. My escape plan fell through.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330113,
						750330114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330113,
					"content": "As expected.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330115,
					"content": "Is there no way for me to escape this pain? Being a warrior is so exhausting. Why can't everything be simpler?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330116,
					"content": "Still preoccupied with thoughts of the flying squad?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330117,
					"content": "I'm sorry, Acomitl. Based on my experience, things don't get simpler that way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330118,
					"content": "Still, I just finished repairing Matahga's arm guards. Manyoya, do yours's need any work? Hmm? We have guests.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330119,
					"content": "Ah, they're adventurers we met during our training away from home, father. They even helped Acomitl out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manyoya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330120,
					"content": "Then greetings, kind friends. I'm Xueyoni, a training master and their father.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Master Trainer of the Flower-Feather Clan"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330121,
					"content": "Acomitl seems to be in terrible condition, so let us know if you need help.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330122,
					"content": "Thank you for the offer, but I think Acomitl is completely fine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330123,
					"content": "Huh? You intend to just leave him be?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330124,
					"content": "Haha! What I'm trying to say is... Let's put it this way. You're adventurers, so you must have joined the Adventurers' Guild, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330125,
					"content": "Now that's an amazing organization. You adventurers desire to explore the world, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330126,
					"content": "Even so, I imagine every adventurer has their motivations. Some explore for the money, others desire knowledge, and some are just bored of doing nothing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330127,
					"content": "So, it's a most impressive feat the Adventurers' Guild has achieved in uniting all those people under one banner.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330128,
					"content": "Take me for example. I'm an old man who retired after serving as a Saurian rider in the flying squad and went on to become a master trainer in our tribe. Yet, I cannot imagine what a Guild containing the master trainers of all six tribes would look like.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330129,
					"content": "Uh... What does that have to do with Acomitl?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330130,
					"content": "That's how our father explains things. Back when he was still in the flying squad, everyone there, even the Qucusaurs, would willingly hear his opinion.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manyoya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330131,
					"content": "He's now a master trainer for our tribe, and anyone who wishes to become a warrior comes to seek his advice, so relax — just listen for now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manyoya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330132,
					"content": "Heh, that's all in the past, Manyoya. But I shall finish the tale all the same.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330133,
					"content": "We master trainers aspire toward the ideal of the \"warrior.\" That's what inspires us to take the time and effort to design and set our training programs up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330134,
					"content": "We all have a \"dream warrior\" we wish to see emerge, but no single person can dictate what such a warrior should be.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330135,
					"content": "We master trainers have found agreeing on any principles and regulations impossible, let alone forming a Guild.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330136,
					"content": "That \"greatest warrior\" has countless faces and personalities.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330137,
					"content": "They are strong-willed at times, but they sometimes struggle with self-doubt — not to mention how they will age and die.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330138,
					"content": "Must warriors be immune to burnout? I can show you multiple woven scrolls that show how self-doubt and exhaustion plague everyone equally.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330139,
					"content": "Must warriors be huge? I know of many who looked like giants yet were despicable beyond compare. Such are recorded upon woven scrolls too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330140,
					"content": "And of course, warriors will decline, as the law of nature dictates.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330141,
					"content": "My kids call me a warrior, but look at me. I'm an old bird who doesn't fly anymore — I've no strength for it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330142,
					"content": "A warrior with a perfect face, a person who conforms to every boring standard, will not be recognized as a hero here in Natlan.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330143,
					"content": "Manyoya, Acomitl, Matahga, I've brought you here, for you are to be the heroes of the Flower-Feather Clan, gazing down from a great height.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330144,
					"content": "Your worries and desires are fleeting states on a hero's long journey, not problems that need solving.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330145,
					"content": "Does leaving the flying squad mean one is no longer a warrior? Does joining the flying squad automatically make one a warrior? There are no such things.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330146,
					"content": "It's okay to have ambitions, to hesitate, and to feel lost. You are a warrior, and a warrior must undergo trials to become a hero.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330147
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330147,
					"content": "Accept how you are now, learn to live with that state, and overcome it. Never let it control you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330148,
					"content": "This is the way of Natlan — the way of heroes. Do you understand?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330149
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330149,
					"content": "I understand, Father.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330150
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manyoya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330150,
					"content": "Acomitl, are you still hesitating?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330151
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330151,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330152,
					"content": "Constant lectures aren't our family's way. Go fly with your brother and sister, just like when you were little.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330153
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330153,
					"content": "Let your mind and body help you decide. Staying cooped up in the house and overthinking things won't lead to any good.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330154
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330154,
					"content": "I got it, Father.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330155
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330155,
					"content": "#Do Master Trainers always speak so abstractly? Paimon didn't really get any of it. Did you, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330156,
						750330157
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330156,
					"content": "Yep. Basically, this will involve a Gliding Challenge.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330158
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330158,
					"content": "Adventurer, I've heard about you from my kids. You're a fascinating young person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330159
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330159,
					"content": "Having the guts to compete with Manyoya, help little Acomitl... and you even gained Matahga's recognition — a true warrior, you are.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330160
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330160,
					"content": "I'd like to invite you to fly with these kids. How about it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330161,
						750330162
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330161,
					"content": "Bring it on.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330163
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330163,
					"content": "Haha, alright. When you've decided, come over and let us know.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330164
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330164,
					"content": "All three of my kids are top-tier fliers in the Flower-Feather Clan. You'll have a great time flying together.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330162,
					"content": "Let me think about it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330163
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330157,
					"content": "Nope. Family upbringing techniques are too profound.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330158
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330114,
					"content": "(Shrug)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330110,
					"content": "It was quite obvious.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330111
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7503302,
