			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750330401,
					"content": "You flew well, young one!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330402,
					"content": "How was my flying just now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330403,
						750330404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330403,
					"content": "Excellent.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330405,
					"content": "Thanks for your encouragement, but I can tell you're still a cut above.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330406,
					"content": "Acomitl...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Matahga"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330407,
					"content": "It's not what you think. I'm not discouraged because I can't outdo others. I can fly, I know I can.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330408,
					"content": "Still, being in bad form for so long has ruined my self-confidence. I just can't approach flying with any sense of calm.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330409,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}'s different. {M#His}{F#Her} posture is way more relaxed. Anyone with eyes can see that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330410,
					"content": "Father, I know that you and sis want me to make up my own mind and not avoid the issue.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330411,
					"content": "But if I told you now, that whether it's my body, my brain, or my heart...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330412,
					"content": "That they all refuse to continue on a path that's not meant for me... Would you still support me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330413,
					"content": "It's okay, so long as it's your own decision, and you're willing to shoulder the consequences.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manyoya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330414,
					"content": "Matahga, will you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330415,
					"content": "Hey! I'm not going to criticize you at a time like this. I've always known the sort of person you are, Big Brother.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Matahga"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330416,
					"content": "If you can't handle this, then just make a decisive break with it. As long as you stay true to yourself, you remain a warrior. No one has the right to criticize you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Matahga"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330417,
					"content": "Sometimes, the job of a Master Trainer is quite easy. I make training plans for warriors, but I don't have to take part myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330418,
					"content": "However, I, too, once flew around with Saurians day in and day out, and I know the true face of that kind of life.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330419,
					"content": "Criticizing others is easy. Taking action is always harder.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330420,
					"content": "As a trainer, I suggest you request time off to recuperate both physically and mentally, even if it leads to dissatisfaction within the team.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330421,
					"content": "As your father, I know you don't want to continue, and I respect that choice.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330422,
					"content": "No longer being part of the flying squad isn't the end of the world. The warriors of the Flower-Feather Clan don't have to prove their worth through flying alone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330423,
					"content": "Thank you... I was worried you'd...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acomitl"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330424,
					"content": "Don't overthink it. We're your family, and we'll always help you find a way, no matter what.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manyoya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330425,
					"content": "Being a warrior sure is tough! Paimon never imagined it would be this hard to join the Flower-Feather Clan's flying squad.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330426,
						750330428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330426,
					"content": "We have our own hardships.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330427
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330427,
					"content": "Ooh, that's right! Thinking about all the things we've encountered along the way, we've overcome them all. That's something we can be proud of, eh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330430,
					"content": "And if becoming a warrior isn't easy in itself, growing from a warrior into a hero is even more so.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330431,
					"content": "I've seen enough of the former to know when someone possesses the qualities needed to become the latter.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330432,
					"content": "You have undergone many trials, haven't you, youngster? I can see it in your eyes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330433,
						750330434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330433,
					"content": "Like you wouldn't believe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330435
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330435,
					"content": "It seems I wasn't mistaken. Your path differs from ours, and you might still have a ways to go. I'd be happy to assist a future hero.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330436,
					"content": "What's more, you've met and helped our family.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330437,
					"content": "If you want to use the training course here, just let me know. You can take off from here anytime.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330438
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330438,
					"content": "Thank you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330439
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330439,
					"content": "Don't mention it. If anything, I'm eager to witness the moment you become a hero, resplendent in the skies.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Xueyoni"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330434,
					"content": "(Remain silent)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330435
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330428,
					"content": "Not everyone can be a warrior.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330429
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330429,
					"content": "That's kinda strict, but it does make sense. Oh well, not like Paimon wanted to become one anyway, what with all that training every day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330404,
					"content": "Not bad.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330405
					]
				}
			]
		},
